FUNCTIONALITY:
-------------
Tool reads receipt bundles from two directories (e.g., x86_64 and aarch64 runners):
1. Loads verdict.json from both bundles
2. Extracts all CBOR receipts (VerificationReceipt and SuccessReceipt)
3. Normalizes JSON to canonical form (sorted keys, BTreeMap)
4. Compares verdicts for byte-identical equality
5. Compares receipt digests for determinism
6. Outputs detailed comparison report: RECEIPT_COMPARISON_REPORT.md
7. Exit codes:
   - 0 = PASS (deterministic, receipts match)
   - 1 = FAIL (non-deterministic, receipts differ)
   - 2 = ERROR (parsing/reading failed)

COMMAND SIGNATURE:
-----------------
receipt_comparator \
  --bundle-a <path/to/x86_64/bundle> \
  --bundle-b <path/to/aarch64/bundle> \
  --output RECEIPT_COMPARISON_REPORT.md \
  --verbose

